1
00:00:24,079 --> 00:00:24,559
Liu Haizhu,

2
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:26,079
just stay right here and think.

3
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,920
Call us when you figure it out.

4
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:45,380
Know me?

5
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:47,579
No, man.

6
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,119
You know who I am?

7
00:00:55,219 --> 00:00:56,320
Pretty cocky, huh?

8
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,359
What're you in for?

9
00:01:03,979 --> 00:01:04,620
Officer!

10
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,239
Officer!

11
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:06,900
What is it?

12
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,359
Hey, Officer!

13
00:01:10,599 --> 00:01:12,420
I told you I was just doing what's right!

14
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,140
Who the hell did you lock me in with?

15
00:01:14,299 --> 00:01:15,099
What's that supposed to mean?

16
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:16,239
Let me tell you something.

17
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:17,340
Whether you're in the clear or not,

18
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:18,920
you'll find out once we investigate.

19
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:20,120
Yelling won't do you any good.

20
00:01:20,439 --> 00:01:21,519
Keep yelling and I'll make it worse for you.

21
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:22,659
Just sit tight and stay quiet.

22
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:38,819
What're you staring at?

23
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,540
He stood up for what's right.

24
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,879
He's a real hero.

25
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,219
Aren't you gonna pour him some water?

26
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,439
Standing there like an idiot.

27
00:02:07,659 --> 00:02:09,000
This cup is called peace water.

28
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:11,960
Drink it, and you're one of us.

29
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:13,520
Whatever you told the cops just now,

30
00:02:13,539 --> 00:02:14,539
I'll pretend I didn't hear it.

31
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,460
What's the matter?

32
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:22,699
Too bland for you?

33
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,500
Want me to add something extra?

34
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,439
What are you waiting for?

35
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:31,120
Don't be so stubborn in here.

36
00:02:32,939 --> 00:02:33,520
You'll only suffer.

37
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:41,939
Is that all you've got?

38
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:51,379
Zhang Laoliu!

39
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:53,419
What are you doing?

40
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:54,680
Officer!

41
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:56,580
I... I was just pouring him some water.

42
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:57,819
No, this kid is way too cocky.

43
00:02:57,979 --> 00:02:58,960
He's out of line, Officer.

44
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,960
Making people drink peace water again, huh?

45
00:03:02,139 --> 00:03:03,419
What? What peace water?

46
00:03:03,539 --> 00:03:04,759
I... I don't even know what that is.

47
00:03:05,259 --> 00:03:06,180
I'm warning you.

48
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:07,659
Behave yourself.

49
00:03:07,879 --> 00:03:09,039
If you dare stir up trouble again,

50
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,120
you'll be dealt with severely.

51
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:10,740
Yes.

52
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,340
Yes, Officer.

53
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:12,280
Liu Haizhu,

54
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,439
you behave yourself too.

55
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,020
Boss.

56
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,680
What are we doing out here?

57
00:03:41,759 --> 00:03:42,620
Keep it down.

58
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,659
I can't take it.

59
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,280
My feet are completely numb.

60
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:47,800
What did I tell you?

61
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,719
You just won't listen.

62
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,560
Look at me.

63
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,120
Wearing three layers.

64
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:53,139
You got yourself all sorted,

65
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,199
bundled up like a mummy.

66
00:03:55,259 --> 00:03:56,219
How are you gonna catch anyone?

67
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,360
We're not catching anyone today.

68
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:02,780
Know what kind of place this is?

69
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:03,979
Zhang Haoran.

70
00:04:04,539 --> 00:04:05,039
Ever heard of him?

71
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:06,819
Isn't he running a brothel?

72
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:08,780
Tell me,

73
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,740
we've been watching for ages,

74
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,939
and only one guy went in.

75
00:04:14,419 --> 00:04:15,280
This place...

76
00:04:15,819 --> 00:04:16,779
doesn't take regular guests.

77
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:18,519
Anyone who knows this spot

78
00:04:19,139 --> 00:04:20,339
is somebody with real clout.

79
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:24,139
Why do they all have to come here?

80
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:26,680
Running a brothel is Zhang Haoran's family trade.

81
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:28,639
His family did this for generations.

82
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,019
After the Liberation,

83
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,019
they were all shut down.

84
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:32,639
Now,

85
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:35,420
he runs average businesses on the surface,

86
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:38,000
but his real wealth and foundation

87
00:04:39,220 --> 00:04:40,980
lie in this shady network.

88
00:04:41,339 --> 00:04:42,120
Then what are we waiting for?

89
00:04:42,339 --> 00:04:42,920
Bust him!

90
00:04:43,019 --> 00:04:43,740
Bust what?

91
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,740
He's slippery as an eel.

92
00:04:45,420 --> 00:04:46,699
He keeps all evidence locked down tight.

93
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:52,579
Wait, Boss.

94
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,800
Weren't we here to investigate

95
00:04:53,959 --> 00:04:55,480
the state asset theft case?

96
00:04:56,699 --> 00:04:59,300
Know who just went in?

97
00:04:59,420 --> 00:04:59,959
Who?

98
00:05:00,879 --> 00:05:02,060
The shipyard's deputy director,

99
00:05:02,699 --> 00:05:03,420
Ma Limin.

100
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:19,000
Director Ma,

101
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:20,920
are you comfortable here at my place?

102
00:05:21,939 --> 00:05:22,399
Very comfortable.

103
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:23,680
I'm almost—

104
00:05:25,699 --> 00:05:26,120
Don't mention it.

105
00:05:26,819 --> 00:05:27,699
When good friends come by,

106
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,160
you've got to treat them to the good stuff.

107
00:05:30,139 --> 00:05:31,480
Then again, if you drink the good stuff

108
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:32,980
and don't get anything done,

109
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,839
wouldn't that feel a bit off?

110
00:05:36,540 --> 00:05:37,100
Boss Zhang,

111
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,959
look, while I've been here,

112
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,740
you've treated me to great food and wine.

113
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:45,519
I truly want to be friends with you.

114
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,420
And Yan'er here,

115
00:05:47,819 --> 00:05:49,540
she's been so hospitable the whole time.

116
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:50,800
Still,

117
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,660
about what you brought up,

118
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:54,660
I've thought it over,

119
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,519
and the risk is just too high.

120
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,279
What high risk?

121
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,079
Just look at my track record.

122
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,680
Which of my jobs was small-time?

123
00:06:03,180 --> 00:06:04,540
Which one didn't the cops dig into?

124
00:06:04,939 --> 00:06:05,740
And what happened in the end?

125
00:06:06,339 --> 00:06:08,319
It was all bark and no bite, wasn't it?

126
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:09,579
You know why?

127
00:06:10,259 --> 00:06:11,779
Because I, Zhang Haoran,

128
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,899
cover my tracks and move fast.

129
00:06:14,379 --> 00:06:16,100
Investigate me? They won't find jack shit!

130
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:17,959
Right, that's true, but—

131
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:19,660
Have an orange.

132
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:21,360
Thank you.

133
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,360
Director Ma,

134
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:25,920
do you have any idea how much you'll make

135
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,680
if we pull this job off?

136
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:28,920
How much?

137
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:32,500
Two thousand?

138
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,939
Think bigger!

139
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:39,180
Add another zero to that.

140
00:06:40,939 --> 00:06:42,779
Even if you stayed clean your whole life,

141
00:06:42,819 --> 00:06:44,300
you'd never make this much money.

142
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:54,279
Sure, but

143
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:58,660
there're so many people at the plant.

144
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:00,360
Auditing,

145
00:07:00,939 --> 00:07:01,500
finance,

146
00:07:01,899 --> 00:07:02,339
security...

147
00:07:02,819 --> 00:07:04,639
So many eyes are watching!

148
00:07:04,779 --> 00:07:06,620
We'd never be able to hide it from them.

149
00:07:07,199 --> 00:07:08,540
Director Ma,

150
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:10,899
what're you still worried about?

151
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:12,540
You flatter me.

152
00:07:13,339 --> 00:07:13,920
Deputy Director.

153
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:14,819
Deputy Director, right.

154
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:18,199
The top boss went to Beijing for training.

155
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,060
It's high-level and long-term.

156
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,639
He's clearly up for a promotion.

157
00:07:23,819 --> 00:07:25,439
When that time comes, won't you be able

158
00:07:27,339 --> 00:07:28,220
to drop the "Deputy"?

159
00:07:29,939 --> 00:07:30,379
Well, yeah.

160
00:07:31,019 --> 00:07:31,800
When that happens,

161
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,259
won't you be calling all the shots?

162
00:07:33,819 --> 00:07:36,279
You'll rule the roost

163
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:37,560
completely.

164
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,379
And as for rolling in the sheets,

165
00:07:44,579 --> 00:07:45,860
don't be shy.

166
00:07:47,779 --> 00:07:48,279
Director Ma,

167
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:49,639
something came up, so I've got to take off.

168
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:50,660
As for my little sister here,

169
00:07:50,819 --> 00:07:51,480
take good care of her for me.

170
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:52,139
That's that.

171
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,199
Wait, Boss Zhang—

172
00:07:53,379 --> 00:07:54,540
Look at you, you're leaving too soon.

173
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,100
You—

174
00:07:57,079 --> 00:07:58,199
Brother Ma,

175
00:08:00,819 --> 00:08:02,560
you've had your fill,

176
00:08:04,699 --> 00:08:06,279
but your little sister is still starving.

177
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,860
You flatter me...

178
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,080
You're pretty strong.

179
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,639
Pretty eager, too.

180
00:08:47,779 --> 00:08:49,259
You little rascal.

181
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:51,159
Boss, something's up!

182
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:52,259
A fight broke out!

183
00:08:54,559 --> 00:08:55,259
I can't take it! Stop!

184
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,059
I give up!

185
00:08:59,379 --> 00:09:00,139
You call that a fight?

186
00:09:00,259 --> 00:09:01,059
You call that a fight?

187
00:09:01,820 --> 00:09:02,779
I gotta go see!

188
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:03,620
What's there to see?

189
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,299
I wanna see why they started fighting!

190
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,259
Give me a break.

191
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:08,740
Come with me. Let's go.

192
00:09:08,860 --> 00:09:09,740
Boss!

193
00:09:12,299 --> 00:09:13,860
Justice always prevails in this world.

194
00:09:14,659 --> 00:09:15,620
I've always believed...

195
00:09:16,139 --> 00:09:17,080
that good always triumphs over evil.

196
00:09:17,899 --> 00:09:18,480
Mr. Feng.

197
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,960
Zhou Meng!

198
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,000
You're so busy,

199
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,620
yet you took the time to visit me.

200
00:09:24,779 --> 00:09:25,580
Please, have a seat.

201
00:09:25,779 --> 00:09:26,419
No need.

202
00:09:27,019 --> 00:09:27,759
Mr. Feng,

203
00:09:28,139 --> 00:09:28,759
Liu Haizhu...

204
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,799
Liu Haizhu was taken away by the police.

205
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:33,320
What happened?

206
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:34,379
I don't know.

207
00:09:34,580 --> 00:09:36,240
The police took him straight from the factory.

208
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,799
They didn't say a word in front of me.

209
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:39,820
I wonder if it's about...

210
00:09:40,419 --> 00:09:42,399
that fight at the factory gate last time.

211
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:43,600
This... This...

212
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,820
He was clearly standing up for what's right!

213
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:46,759
He was helping me!

214
00:09:46,879 --> 00:09:47,919
Why would they arrest him?

215
00:09:48,299 --> 00:09:49,159
Exactly!

216
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,500
Mr. Feng,

217
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:51,720
those guys last time...

218
00:09:51,940 --> 00:09:53,259
they were clearly after you.

219
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:55,340
If the cops took him in for questioning,

220
00:09:55,779 --> 00:09:57,019
did they come looking for you too?

221
00:09:59,379 --> 00:10:01,120
Ms. Wang, did anyone come looking for me?

222
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,059
No.

223
00:10:05,379 --> 00:10:06,379
Nobody came by at all.

224
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,139
Oh my God.

225
00:10:09,179 --> 00:10:10,480
Now we can't get in touch with him,

226
00:10:11,259 --> 00:10:12,460
and we have no idea what's going on.

227
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:14,700
Mr. Feng,

228
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:15,700
how about this?

229
00:10:16,139 --> 00:10:17,299
Come with me to the police station.

230
00:10:17,639 --> 00:10:19,679
We'll set the record straight with them.

231
00:10:20,460 --> 00:10:21,080
Alright, alright.

232
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,000
I'll go with you.

233
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,659
Could it be about that other thing?

234
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,740
I remember he went with my brother once...

235
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:29,820
to see Li Laogunzi.

236
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:32,759
Didn't something happen after that?

237
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,500
They got into another brawl afterward.

238
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,779
Yeah, I think so.

239
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,120
I'll go look for him right now.

240
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,519
Do you know where my brother is?

241
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:44,840
Where is he?

242
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,179
My brother's over at...

243
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,639
Warehouse No. 8 behind the station.

244
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:48,960
Behind the station...

245
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:49,480
Thanks!

246
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:50,799
Don't worry!

247
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:53,059
I'll explain it to the police later!

248
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,440
Well...

249
00:10:57,620 --> 00:10:58,639
This broad...

250
00:10:59,259 --> 00:11:01,279
Isn't she seeing Liu Haizhu?

251
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,419
Don't be shy.

252
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:18,460
Eat up.

253
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,440
Eat my heart,

254
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,120
eat my liver,

255
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:28,779
eat my heart and soul.

256
00:11:32,139 --> 00:11:32,779
Yan'er...

257
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:34,659
Is it good?

258
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:38,200
It's insanely good, babe.

259
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,360
You little vixen.

260
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,120
You're driving me crazy.

261
00:11:45,019 --> 00:11:46,779
You might as well take my kidneys, too.

262
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:04,019
Ma Limin, what the hell are you doing?

263
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:06,779
Wait, Boss Zhang...

264
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:08,100
What are you doing here?

265
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:09,840
Wait...

266
00:12:10,299 --> 00:12:11,919
Didn't you tell me...

267
00:12:12,059 --> 00:12:13,879
to take good care of her?

268
00:12:15,659 --> 00:12:16,679
She's my sister!

269
00:12:18,419 --> 00:12:19,179
Is this how you care for her?

270
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,480
By getting butt-naked in bed with her?

271
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:24,940
We just had some food and drinks...

272
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,240
What the hell do you mean, food and drinks?!

273
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,759
Food and drinks, my ass!

274
00:12:29,980 --> 00:12:30,600
Put your clothes on!

275
00:12:31,039 --> 00:12:31,480
Get down here!

276
00:12:33,259 --> 00:12:33,759
Boss Zhang...

277
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:34,600
Hurry up!

278
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:39,019
Didn't you say to take good care of her?

279
00:12:40,919 --> 00:12:42,299
Ma Limin, hurry the hell up!

280
00:12:43,379 --> 00:12:44,320
Come on, Boss Zhang...

281
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:45,440
Since you were coming back,

282
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:46,620
why didn't you let me know?

283
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:47,500
So what?

284
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,360
Coming to my own home,

285
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:49,539
I have to report to you first?

286
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:51,120
No, that's not it...

287
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,539
You drop by to "check on the people,"

288
00:12:53,139 --> 00:12:54,080
drinking plenty of my Moutai,

289
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:56,120
having a damn good time with Yan'er...

290
00:12:56,700 --> 00:12:58,000
Yet when I ask you for one simple favor,

291
00:12:58,159 --> 00:12:59,480
why do I only hear footsteps,

292
00:12:59,539 --> 00:13:00,519
but never see anyone come down?

293
00:13:01,399 --> 00:13:02,179
What's your deal?

294
00:13:02,519 --> 00:13:03,519
Playing me for a fool, are you?

295
00:13:03,779 --> 00:13:05,779
Boss Zhang, listen to yourself.

296
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:07,440
That business of yours...

297
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:08,279
that's theft...

298
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:16,080
That's illegally selling off state assets.

299
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:17,399
It's a matter of principle.

300
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:18,980
I have my own concerns.

301
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,600
We're in different positions. You wouldn't get it.

302
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:22,440
What concerns?

303
00:13:22,700 --> 00:13:23,799
Giving me bureaucratic bullshit, are you?

304
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,600
Just find a scapegoat and be done with it!

305
00:13:26,919 --> 00:13:27,899
If the sky falls, someone else takes the hit.

306
00:13:28,039 --> 00:13:28,840
Why would it fall on you?

307
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:31,840
A scapegoat isn't that easy to find.

308
00:13:32,759 --> 00:13:33,440
Besides,

309
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:35,440
doing that ruins your karma.

310
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,419
A man like me...

311
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,200
I believe in Buddha.

312
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:41,120
Compassion is everything to me.

313
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:42,500
I need to accumulate merit.

314
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:43,200
And then I...

315
00:13:44,179 --> 00:13:44,600
What?

316
00:13:44,659 --> 00:13:45,179
Believe in what?

317
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,559
All they want is offerings, right?

318
00:13:47,019 --> 00:13:47,440
Let me show you

319
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:48,919
what merit in cold, hard cash looks like.

320
00:13:49,299 --> 00:13:50,259
Open the middle cabinet door.

321
00:13:51,860 --> 00:13:52,360
Open it!

322
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,940
This stack is 1,000 yuan.

323
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,059
Consider it your deposit.

324
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:18,080
Once the goods leave the warehouse,

325
00:14:19,659 --> 00:14:21,399
there are 20 more stacks in here for you.

326
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,200
That's what I call merit.

327
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:29,980
Bro!

328
00:14:30,539 --> 00:14:31,019
Bro!

329
00:14:32,639 --> 00:14:33,080
Bro!

330
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:36,019
Kong Fanping is here!

331
00:14:36,779 --> 00:14:37,679
K-Kong Fanping?

332
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,399
Isn't he a cop?

333
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:41,419
No way.

334
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,500
If they see me, I'm done for!

335
00:14:42,899 --> 00:14:43,340
I have to get out of here.

336
00:14:44,299 --> 00:14:46,039
He's at the door! Where can you go?

337
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:47,500
Then what do I do?

338
00:14:47,539 --> 00:14:49,120
If I'm exposed, it's over!

339
00:14:49,759 --> 00:14:50,440
What do we do?

340
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:52,200
What's going on?

341
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:53,240
Listen up.

342
00:14:53,379 --> 00:14:54,399
No matter what happens,

343
00:14:54,559 --> 00:14:55,419
not a single sound out of you.

344
00:14:56,100 --> 00:14:56,500
Hurry!

345
00:15:01,519 --> 00:15:02,480
Company's here!

346
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:12,440
We're from the Songjiang Branch,
Songliao Public Security Bureau.

347
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:13,639
Old Kong.

348
00:15:13,820 --> 00:15:14,399
We go way back.

349
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,460
Tell her to drop the routine.

350
00:15:17,100 --> 00:15:17,580
Besides,

351
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:19,659
it's dinner time.

352
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:21,559
How did your men catch the scent

353
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,080
and barge in on an honest citizen's meal?

354
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:24,200
Watch your mouth.

355
00:15:26,419 --> 00:15:27,519
Such a big spread of food...

356
00:15:28,879 --> 00:15:29,720
Just the two of you eating?

357
00:15:31,279 --> 00:15:33,100
How about I get you some chopsticks,

358
00:15:33,899 --> 00:15:34,460
and you join us?

359
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:36,340
I'll grab some booze, and we can drink.

360
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:36,840
Come on.

361
00:15:36,980 --> 00:15:37,620
Cui'er, pull up a stool.

362
00:15:37,919 --> 00:15:38,480
Cut the act.

363
00:15:40,139 --> 00:15:40,899
We're on official duty.

364
00:15:42,100 --> 00:15:42,899
Zhang Haoran.

365
00:15:43,139 --> 00:15:45,320
Someone reported you for prostitution.

366
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,220
Come down to the station with us.

367
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,340
What do you mean, prostitution?

368
00:15:47,639 --> 00:15:48,559
Who are you calling a whore?

369
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:49,899
Cui'er, Cui'er!

370
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:53,799
Look...

371
00:15:54,139 --> 00:15:55,460
The people's police serve the people,

372
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,399
so we citizens ought to cooperate, right?

373
00:16:01,419 --> 00:16:02,539
Did you bring handcuffs?

374
00:16:02,879 --> 00:16:04,539
Are you cuffing me, or should I?

375
00:16:06,100 --> 00:16:06,879
Just walk with us.

376
00:16:08,539 --> 00:16:08,919
Fine.

377
00:16:09,039 --> 00:16:10,259
Let's go, let's go.
